sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Human
  participant W as Workstream
  participant A as Agent Harness
  participant M as Memory
  participant E as Evidence
  H->>W: define objective, sources, rules
  W->>A: start run
  A->>M: load context/memory pack
  A->>A: execute tools in sandbox
  A->>E: attach evidence packet
  E->>H: request review
  H->>W: approve or correct
  W->>M: store reviewed memory/rules
